**Key idea:** Shift bits out of `x` from the LSB end and into `out` from its LSB end, 32 times: `out = (out << 1) | (x & 1); x >>= 1;`. The first bit taken (bit 0) ends up as bit 31. Use **unsigned** types so shifts are logical.

