| Step | Value |
| --- | --- |
| S = 1+2+3 | 6 |
| Q = 1+4+9 | 14 |
| (S² − Q)/2 = (36 − 14)/2 | **11** |
| check: 1·2 + 1·3 + 2·3 | 2 + 3 + 6 = 11 ✔ |
| after update a[1]=5: S = 9, Q = 35 | (81 − 35)/2 = **23** |

